Looking again at the deploy, the most likely culprit is in the custom‑metadata records (the Apex itself compiles cleanly). I've tightened the CMDT files to the exact structure the platform expects (declared the `xsd` namespace explicitly, removed the unneeded `Bypass_Execution__c` entry so only valid/required fields are set), and kept the Apex logic the same with the inner‑class trigger action resolved via its fully‑qualified `Outer.Inner` name.

